OL,3,ALondon musical cancelled after Ariana
OL,4,AGrande and Jonathan Bailey pull out
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe upcoming London revival of Sunday
OL,7,FIn The Park With George has been
OL,8,Fcancelled after A-listers Ariana Grande
OL,9,Fand Jonathan Bailey dropped out.
OL,11,FThe Wicked stars had been due to
OL,12,Freunite on stage in the Stephen
OL,13,FSondheim show at the Barbican next
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FLast month, Grande announced she was
OL,17,Fpulling out of the musical as part of
OL,18,Fher decision to take a break from the
OL,19,Fspotlight after completing her Eternal
OL,20,FSunshine Tour.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
