OL,3,ALondon musical cancelled after Ariana
OL,4,AGrande and Jonathan Bailey pull out
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this month, Bailey also
OL,7,Frevealed he was withdrawing from the
OL,8,Fshow. Production company Empire Street
OL,9,FProductions initially said it would
OL,10,Fcontinue as planned but on Monday
OL,11,Fannounced the musical would no longer
OL,12,Fbe staged in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
